; An ARRAY-of-`any` as a TYPE-CHOICE ARM (`[* any] / tstr`) panics generation at an
; `Option::unwrap()` on `None` in generation/serialize.rs (`encoding_var_is_copy` walking the
; `any` element) under `--wasm=false`; with wasm on it dies earlier at the member-position
; `generic_instances` assert (the any_member.cddl class). DISTINCT from the bare-`any` arm
; (`any / tstr`, tests/robustness/choice_any_arm.cddl — unstorable arm, rust_type.rs unwrap):
; here the arm IS storable (an array wrapper), IR construction succeeds, and the serialize
; emission for the choice's variant is what dies. Surfaced by the recombination sweep
; (src/tests/recombination_tests.rs, composition class outer=choice_member inner=occurrence
; filler=prelude.any).
a = [* any] / tstr
